ublic  life in south africa i think a lot of  them think that his role in that has  been overwritten overplayed over  accredited by by people like us i was  speaking to an analyst just before i  came to speak to you called leiberhong  peco and she said to me look this man  was not an angel the power that he said  that he handed over to black south  africans was never his power to hand  over in the first place that power had  been taken by force from the black  people of south africa and he has left a  whole lot of questions that need to be  answered in the in the words of miss  peco where are the bodies where are the  documents where are the documents which  describe the crimes of the apartheid  regime a lot of people say we just  haven't seen evidence of who was  responsible and they hold  this man fw to clerk for many of those  crimes  all right john good to see you we'll  chat to you a little later thanks for  now
 

